out the main story. Even side story teach you how to do things. So if you are those who want to get to end game quick, do main story quest and everything will unlock. Once everything unlock, you can grind and chill.\n\nQuest story 6/10, just because you have no real progress system with NPC that you rooted for in game, no connection, NPC in quest just pop in here and there, that is it.\n\nGameplay 7/10, let me expained why...\n-2 Points cause of heavily balancing issue with Descendant, but they are working on it. \n-1 Point cause of Female descendants will out-shrine male descendants in this game, in both combat and costume. They are also working on it, on male, slowly.\n\nGraphic, performance. You can see my specs, I don't think I got potatoe PC.\n8/10, let me explained why.\n-1 Point cause I often CTD here and there, reason? Because I use borderless window mode and browser at the same time? I don't ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ know.\n-1 Point cause sometime the game froze when I try to enter the login menu and the reason? I don't ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ know why I can't use browser at the same time without it being CTD or Froze. I don't have issue with other game.", "timestamp_created": 1782098255, "timestamp_updated": 1782098255, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "hardware": {"system_ram": "31861", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D 8-Core Processor           ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti", "vram_size": 15995}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228538863", "author": {"steamid": "76561198764858816", "personaname": "moewhyte.mw", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198764858816/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 41569, "play